  "body": "Discover the pinnacle of Takapuna living. These high-spec residences combine contemporary elegance with rare practical luxury—including a private elevator serving all three levels.\r\n\r\nKey Highlights:\r\n\r\n• Accessibility: The internal lift provides seamless access for seniors or family members with limited mobility.\r\n\r\n• Space & Style: 4 Bedrooms | 3.5 Bathrooms | Double Internal Garage.\r\n\r\n• Gourmet Living: Designer kitchen with open-plan dining and living, perfect for entertaining.\r\n\r\n• Education Excellence: Zoned for Takapuna School, TNIS, Westlake Girls, and Takapuna Grammar.\r\n\r\n• Peace of Mind: Brand new construction with a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee.\r\n\r\nExperience a home that grows with you. Move between floors at the touch of a button and enjoy the very best of the North Shore lifestyle.",
